sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Candidate / browser
    participant V as Input + VAD
    participant K as Turn controller
    participant G as Gemini
    participant R as Rumik adapter
    participant O as Output transport
    R->>O: Audio for response generation 7
    O->>C: Interviewer speaks
    C->>V: Candidate resumes speaking
    V->>K: Confirmed speech-start
    K->>K: Advance response generation to 8
    K->>G: Cancel obsolete generation 7
    K->>R: Cancel queued work for generation 7
    K->>O: Broadcast interruption; clear output
    O->>C: Request playback stop
    Note over C,O: Measure actual audible stop at the client
    Note over V,K: Keep the same pending answer and segment ownership
    V->>K: Valid delayed STT final for that answer
    K->>K: Retain final by connection + segment identity
    R-->>O: Late audio tagged generation 7
    O->>O: Drop stale audio before playback
    Note over K,R: Recheck generation before accepting text or audio
